# ACL Labs

Hands-on Cisco Packet Tracer labs focused on Access Control Lists (ACLs).

## Topics Practiced

- Standard ACLs
- Extended ACLs
- ACL configuration
- Source and destination filtering
- Protocol and port filtering
- Applying ACLs to interfaces
- ACL troubleshooting
- Traffic verification

## Verification Commands

show access-lists
show ip access-lists
show running-config
show ip interface
ping
